@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml
title HANBAY - Checkout, cash settlement and actual time
autonumber
actor "Receptionist / Manager / Admin" as Staff
boundary "Front Desk FE" as FE
control "Check-out API" as API
control "CheckOutService" as Service
database PostgreSQL as DB
Staff -> FE: Open checkout; enter charges, collection, note
FE -> API: PATCH /bookings/{bookingId}/check-out
API -> Service: checkOut(bookingId, request)
group Single transaction
  Service -> DB: Lock booking then assigned room
  Service -> Service: Validate CHECKED_IN/OCCUPIED, scheduled date
  Service -> Service: If strictly after12 require note
  Service -> Service: Recompute debt including fees and received cash
  alt Invalid / unpaid / overcollection
    Service --> API: Validation or409; rollback
  else Valid settlement
    Service -> DB: Save CASH receipt/transaction if positive collection
    Service -> DB: CHECKED_OUT + actual UTC checked_out_at + history
    Service -> DB: Room DIRTY; commit
    Service --> API: Result with actual timestamp and final balance
  end
end
API --> FE: Success or error
FE --> Staff: Show persisted result
note over Service, DB
No automatic extra night or checkout.
No cleaning task creation; housekeeper reads DIRTY rooms.
Early checkout uses separate command, actual date = hotelToday.
end note
@enduml
